## Production checklist

- [ ] Change Grafana credentials (`GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD`)
{% if config.use_database %}
- [ ] Change database password (`DB_PASSWORD`)
{% endif %}
- [ ] Lower `OTEL_SAMPLING_PROBABILITY` to `0.05`–`0.1`
- [ ] Set resource `requests` and `limits` on all containers
- [ ] Review `management.endpoints.web.exposure.include` — expose only what you need
